# Files Wrangler must not upload to the public site.
#
# Stronger than the _redirects rules, which only hide a file that was published
# anyway: anything listed here never reaches the edge at all. _redirects stays
# in place as well, because it also covers the Netlify copy and gives a real
# 404 page rather than a bare miss.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore. Nothing the apps load at runtime is listed.

# Full TypeScript source of the api, stripe and notify edge functions. These are
# deployed to Supabase, never fetched by a browser.
supabase/

# Agent and tooling config that ships in the repo for local development.
.mcp.json
.claude/
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.gitignore

# Build config for the other two publishers; neither is used by this Worker.
_config.yml
netlify.toml
wrangler.jsonc

# Project documentation, not part of the app.
README.md
STRIPE-SETUP.md
BOBCAT_1.pdf
